Provides: onak
Description: OpenPGP Key Server (foopgp fork with extra cleaning policies)
 onak is an OpenPGP compatible keyserver which supports multiple subkeys,
 photo ids and path finding between keys. It can provide an HKP
 compatible interface for use with the --keyserver option of gnupg as
 well as including a command line tool for querying the key database.
 .
 This is the foopgp fork: vanilla onak with extra hygiene patches
 maintained against upstream pull requests:
 .
   * cap_uids_per_key / cap_uats_per_key  (PR #6, merged upstream)
   * onak aged / dump-aged / clean-aged   (PR #7)
   * a minimal Mustache template engine wiring the CGI lookup
     pages to /usr/share/onak/templates/{vanilla,foopgp}/, plus
     the 2-column foopgp HTML layout served by default
   * dedupe per-signer signatures         (PR #8)
   * drop v3 keys unconditionally
   * max_sigs_per_uid / max_sigs_per_uat
 .
 Once all five patches land in upstream onak this package goes away
 and we revert to vanilla onak.
